1
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:11,240
Are you tired of choosing a cool outfit to wear for special occasions?

2
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:14,220
Well, now you don’t have to!

3
00:00:15,040 --> 00:00:21,595
The all-new Trendy-wise is easy to use and you don’t have to be trendy to use it.

4
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:29,320
However, before you can use it, you have to take photos of all the clothes in your wardrobe.

5
00:00:30,020 --> 00:00:34,520
And you mustn’t forget to take photos of all your shoes and socks, too.

6
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:41,780
Then all you have to do is click on a photo of, for example, a blue T-shirt.

7
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:52,260
The Trendy-wise selects photos of trousers or skirts, shoes, socks, etc., from your wardrobe to go with this T-shirt.

8
00:00:53,620 --> 00:00:59,680
Each time it creates a different outfit for you and the outfits are all very trendy.

9
00:01:00,700 --> 00:01:02,380
Oh, I almost forgot!

10
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:11,820
You also have to type in the kind of event/occasion, for example: a concert or a birthday party.

11
00:01:13,220 --> 00:01:15,640
Do you sometimes have bad dreams?

12
00:01:16,240 --> 00:01:18,440
Do you wake up scared or unhappy?

13
00:01:19,240 --> 00:01:19,620
Yes?

14
00:01:20,360 --> 00:01:22,180
Then you should buy the DreamCatcher.

15
00:01:23,440 --> 00:01:24,480
This is how it works:

16
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:28,100
Put the machine on your head before you go to bed.

17
00:01:28,820 --> 00:01:41,380
Tell it what you want or don’t want by speaking into the microphone – for example: ‘I want dreams where I win a singing competition’ or ‘I don’t want dreams about falling.’

18
00:01:42,620 --> 00:01:48,020
When you are asleep, DreamCatcher will follow your dreams and make sure you get what you want.

19
00:01:48,800 --> 00:01:51,740
Imagine that in your dream you do something dangerous.

20
00:01:52,420 --> 00:01:54,600
DreamCatcher will make sure you’re safe.

21
00:01:55,220 --> 00:01:56,360
Here’s an example.

22
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:59,860
Let’s say you start to climb a high mountain.

23
00:02:00,580 --> 00:02:05,620
You don’t have to worry because the DreamCatcher will make you walk back down again.

24
00:02:05,620 --> 00:02:08,800
But you mustn’t use the machine every night.

25
00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:11,900
It will only work every three days.
